# <%= it.projectName %> - Experimental Edge Developer Guide

## Commands
- **Dev:** `npx nx serve <app-name>`
- **Build:** `npx nx build <app-name>`
- **Test:** `npx nx test <app-name>`
- **Lint All:** `pnpm run lint` (Oxlint)

## Project Structure
- `apps/api/`: NestJS backend
- `apps/web/`: Angular frontend (Vite 8 + Rolldown)
- `libs/shared/`: Shared TypeScript libraries/DTOs

## Tech Stack
- Frontend: Angular 21 (via Vite 8 + Rolldown)
- Compiler: @oxc-angular/vite (Rust-based, experimental)
- Backend: NestJS
- Validation: Zod
- Workspace: Nx Monorepo
- Test: Vitest 4

## Experimental Status
This stack uses @oxc-angular/vite (v0.0.28) — a pre-alpha Rust-based
Angular compiler by VoidZero. Not recommended for production.
